<html><head><title>Why</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><img id="imagen" src="3_Researcher_files/researchertrail03.jpg" width="90%" onerror="this.style.display='none'" style="display: none;">                                                                                     <h3 style="margin-top:14.05pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:14.05pt;
margin-left:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">WHY</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></h3><h1 style="font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;">

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-weight: 700; margin: 12pt 0cm;"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Reconsidering Academia: Navigating the Future
through Transdisciplinary Work</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 12pt 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;">Our society and planet face significant
challenges that require new ways of thinking. These 'wicked problems'—complex
issues that cannot be solved easily&nbsp; —demand
collaboration across disciplines and institutions.</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 12pt 0cm;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Researchers play a crucial role in this process.
They can set goals, choose methods, and evaluate results to understand and
improve the world. By including educational and societal partners in research
teams, students and partners also develop a research mindset for tackling
complexity.</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 12pt 0cm;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB"><b>New Skills and Competencies</b></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 12pt 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;">Transdisciplinary education focuses on
addressing complex problems and creating impact. Through perspective shifts,
you develop skills such as empathy, collaboration, and open-mindedness. The
collaborative approach ensures that all participants benefit and learn, in
order to fundamentally transform the world.</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p></h1><p style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;"></p></body></html>